    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'm also seeing a lot of literature on how the decline of these institutions correlates with higher rates of social fragmentation and loneliness in modern secular societies. do you think the move toward secularism is inherently destabilizing for community bonds?",
